OL,3,AUK net migration drops to lowest level
OL,4,Asince 1997 as number of people claiming
OL,5,Aasylum also falls
OL,6,
OL,7,FHenry Zeffman analysis: This is a big
OL,8,Fmoment and it's likely to be attributed
OL,9,Fto measures taken under the Tories -
OL,10,Fbut Labour will argue they've achieved
OL,11,Fin two years what their predecessors
OL,12,Fcouldn't in 14
OL,14,FHome Secretary Shabana Mahmood says the
OL,15,Fgovernment has "restored control";
OL,16,Fshadow home secretary Chris Philp says
OL,17,Fpeople are leaving the UK "because of
OL,18,FLabour's high taxes whilst non-EU
OL,19,Fimmigration remains far too high"
